</strong></p><p><strong>This&nbsp;tech&nbsp;demo&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;left&nbsp;up&nbsp;in case anyone&nbsp;wants&nbsp;to&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;it&nbsp;for&nbsp;what&nbsp;it&nbsp;is,&nbsp;or&nbsp;for&nbsp;anyone&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;inspiration&nbsp;from.&nbsp;<br></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong>Thank you all for your support on this journey.<br></strong><strong></strong><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tRaise The Dead is a zombie experimentation game. Perform research and experiments on zombies. Craft potions. Grow various plants and upgrade your equipment. Your ultimate goal is to find a cure to the zombie outbreak.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tFeatures:<br>\r\n\t<br>\r\n\t- Capture zombies and place them in cells.<br>\r\n\t- Synthesize various potions.<br>\r\n\t- Use potions to perform experiments on zombies.<br>\r\n\t- Research and develop new upgrades, potions and tech.<br>\r\n\t- Farm plants.<br>\r\n\t- Play around with the cutest of zombies. <br></p><p><br>\r\n</p><p><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/645530/Raise_The_Dead\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\r\n\t </a><a href=\"http://eepurl.com/cMMu1T\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Mailing List</a><strong><br></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><span></span></strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_1095605\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><t